window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Forbidden magic. Doomed love. A rising darkness that could devour the world.</b></p> <p>For centuries, necromancy has been erased from the Five Kingdoms. Its secrets buried. Its relics destroyed. But when High Prince Henry’s dark mage discovers an ancient artifact of unimaginable power, something long dead begins to awaken.</p> <p><b>Khaldun</b>, a young wayfarer wizard, lives in the shadow of his father’s legend. Rejected by the mage academies for his bloodline, he longs for a chance to prove himself. <b>Mira</b>, born between two worlds, hides a secret even she doesn’t understand—magic itself cannot touch her.</p> <p>When their paths collide after a brutal attack, Khaldun and Mira are pulled into a struggle that will decide the fate of Anoria. As armies rise and old powers return, they’ll face impossible choices, forbidden magic, and the awakening of an evil that once nearly destroyed the world.</p> <p><b>Epic battles. Forbidden romance. Ancient sorcery reborn.</b></p> <p>If you love <i>The Witcher</i>, <i>Mistborn</i>, or <i>The Wheel of Time</i>, step into <b>Wizard</b>—the breathtaking beginning of <b>The Mage Saga</b>.</p>"; 
